  "plot": "After a wealthy American and his family are murdered, Jack Ryan is assigned to examine the circumstances surrounding the case. As Ryan follows financial connections leading toward a powerful Colombian cartel, President Bennett, James Cutter, and Robert Ritter push for increasingly aggressive responses behind the scenes. Meanwhile, cartel figures Ernesto Escobedo and Felix Cortez maneuver to protect their interests while exploiting divisions within the American government. With new evidence emerging and competing agendas taking shape, Ryan finds himself navigating a dangerous landscape where political calculations and covert operations place mounting pressure on every decision.",
